{"strongs": "H6924", "word": "קֶ֫דֶם", "translit": "qe.dem", "root": "קדם", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "front, east, aforetime", "definition": "קֶ֫דֶם noun [masculine] front, east, aforetime ; — absolute ׳ ק Deut 33:27 +, קֶ֑קֶם Judg 8:10 +; construct קֶדֶם Prov 8:22 once plural construct קַדְמֵי v Prov 8:23 — 1. location \\ \\ a. front , ׳ מִקּ Isa 9:11 from the front (i.e. East), in front (opposed to מֵאָחוֺר ), ׳ אָחוֺר וָק Ps 139:5 behind and before ; אֶהֳלֹךְ ׳ ק Job 23:8 I go forward (opposed to אָחוֺר ) \\ \\ b. East: ׳ הַרהַֿקּ Gen 10:30 ( J ) mount of the East ; ׳ בְּנֵיקֿ = dwellers in the east, tribes east or northeast of Canaan Gen 29:1 ( E ), Judg 6:3 ; Judg 6:33 ; Judg 7:12 ; Judg 8:10 ; 1Kgs 5:10 ; Isa 11:14 ; Jer 49:28 ; Ezek 25:4 ; Ezek 25:10 ; Job 1:3 ׳ הַרְרֵי ק Num 23:7 , see Di Sachau: Reise (1883), 159 ff.165 ff. Dr in Hast. PETHOS ; ׳ אֶרֶץ ק Gen 25:6 ( J ); מָֽלְאוּ מִקֶּדֶם Isa 2:6 they are full from the east (insert probably קֶסֶם , מִקְסָם , or < קֹסְמִים before ׳ מִקּ , compare Lo De Du Che Hpt Di-Kit ); elsewhere ׳ מִקּ = eastward: (I) in the east Gen 2:8 (2) on the eastern (side) Gen 12:8 ( J ) Zech 14:4 לְ ׳ מִקּ on the east of Gen 3:24 ( J ), Gen 12:8 ( J ), Num 34:1 l ( P ), Josh 7:2 ( J E ), Judg 8:11 ; Ezek 11:23 = Jonah 4:5 (3) eastward , with verb of motion Gen 11:2 ; Gen 13:11 (both J ). 2. temporal, ancient time, aforetime: \\ \\ a. ׳ הַרְרֵי ק Deut 33:15 ancient mountains , compare ׳ אֱלֹהֵי ק v Deut 33:27 , ׳ מַלְכֵיקֿ Isa 19:11 , ׳ בִּשְׁמֵי שְׁמֵיקֿ Ps 68:34 . \\ \\ b. ׳ כִּימֵי ק Ps 44:2 in ancient days ; compare ׳ מִימֵי ק from of old Isa 23:7 ; Mic 7:20 ; Lam 1:7 ; Lam 2:17 ; Isa 37:26 = ׳ לְמִימֵי ק ) 2Kgs 19:25 (see מִן 9b (2)); ׳ כִּימֵי ק Isa 51:9 ; Jer 46:26 ׳ יַרְחֵי ק Job 29:2 months of old. \\ \\ c. ׳ מִקּ from of old Mic 5:1 ; Isa 45:21 ; Isa 46:10 ; Hab 1:12 ; Neh 12:46 ; Ps 77:12 ׳ מִנִּיק 7; Ps 8:2 springing out of, derived from, ancient times (compare Dr ); ׳ יָמִים מִקּ Ps 77:6 ; Ps 143:5 days from of old . \\ \\ d. ׳ ק alone, as adverb anciently, of old Ps 74:2 ; Ps 119:152 ׳ כְּק Jer 30:20 ; Lam 5:21 ׳ ישֵׁב ק Ps 55:20 he that sitteth (enthroned from) of old. \\ \\ e. beginning, מִקַּדְמֵיאָֿ֑רֶץ Prov 8:23 from the beginnings of the earth ; מִפְעָלָיו ׳ ק Prov 8:22 the beginning of his works (|| רֵאשִׁית ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7303')\">BDB7303</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6924')\">H6924</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7302')\">BDB7302</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7304')\">BDB7304</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>קֶ֫דֶם</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>front, east, aforetime</highlightword>; — absolute<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 33:27\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,27)\">Deut 33:27</ref> +, <bdbheb>קֶ֑קֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 8:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,10)\">Judg 8:10</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>קֶדֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 8:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,22)\">Prov 8:22</ref> once plural construct <bdbheb>קַדְמֵי</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Prov 8:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,23)\">Prov 8:23</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> location <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>front</highlight>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִקּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 9:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,9,11)\">Isa 9:11</ref> <highlight>from the front</highlight> (i.e. East), <highlight>in front</highlight> (opposed to <bdbheb>מֵאָחוֺר</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אָחוֺר וָק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 139:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"139\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"139\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,139,5)\">Ps 139:5</ref> <highlight>behind and before</highlight>; <bdbheb>אֶהֳלֹךְ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 23:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,23,8)\">Job 23:8</ref> <highlight>I go forward</highlight> (opposed to <bdbheb>אָחוֺר</bdbheb>) <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>East:</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַרהַֿקּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 10:30\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,30)\">Gen 10:30</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <highlight>mount of the East</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּנֵיקֿ</bdbheb> = dwellers in the east, tribes east or northeast of Canaan <ref ref=\"Gen 29:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,29,1)\">Gen 29:1</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Judg 6:3\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,3)\">Judg 6:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 6:33\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,33)\">Judg 6:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 7:12\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(7,7,12)\">Judg 7:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 8:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,10)\">Judg 8:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:10\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,10)\">1Kgs 5:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 11:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,14)\">Isa 11:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 49:28\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,28)\">Jer 49:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 25:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,25,4)\">Ezek 25:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 25:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,25,10)\">Ezek 25:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 1:3\" b=\"18\" cBe